license: "CC-BY-4.0"
abstract: "Derived, aggregate-only topic and entity tables for the nagari@googlegroups.com closed mailing-list archive (2005-2026): a curated 9-parent/37-child topic taxonomy and a texts/scholars/dictionaries/tools-and-places entity gazetteer applied to 18,729 messages, aggregated to thread-, topic-, and entity-level counts, plus lemmatized key-phrase collocations. No message bodies, subject full text, or email addresses are included."
keywords:
  - Indology
  - Sanskrit
  - mailing-list archive
  - topic modeling
  - entity extraction
  - digital humanities
